<title>UK: EBRD sets 40 billion drachma five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>EBRD sets 40 billion drachma five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Citibank International (books), National Bank of Greece (books) and Telesis Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT</p>
<p> AMT     40 BLN GRD   BASE	1M-ATHIBOR MATURITY    24.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    -85 BP     PAY DATE    24.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE 100.10     FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER   100.10</p>
<p> LISTING    ATH/LUX   DENOMS (M) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GREEK     HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
